# The AAM stack: four mappers, one rdkit, one atom identity.
#
# `container:` is what makes R6 runnable off one workstation. Until it existed the
# metabolism half was MAMBA-only -- not by preference but by construction, because an
# env declaration with no `container:` key cannot satisfy a container runtime and
# `Agent.runtime` is one global setting. Built by docker/ecspr_bake
# (dev.sh --build --sif --sync); the SIF is placed in the cluster's apptainer image
# store under the name metasmith derives from this URI, so nothing is pulled.
#
# A SEPARATE image from equilibrator.env, and not by choice: equilibrator-cache 0.7.1
# requires numpy>=2 while torch 2.2.1 is compiled against the numpy 1.x C API.
container: docker://quay.io/hallamlab/ecspr_bake:aam
conda: build-refs-rdkit
